# Permanents lab: Companions, Structures, Items, Remnants. Equip the Flame Blade (2AP) and the
# Spark Amulet (its Jolt is paid from the carrier's AP); Ash's Kindle creates a Fire Warrior
# from Ash's own pool; the Fire Barrack musters one too; Recall bounces, Blink flickers;
# Raise the Fallen brings a Remnant back.
name Permanents lab
seed 4
map hexagon 4
start A 0,3
start B 0,-3
home A radius=1
home B radius=1
neutral fill terrain.fire
champion A champion.pyra
champion B champion.thorn
terraindeck A terrain.fire*7
terraindeck B terrain.darkness*7
openinghand 0
noshuffle
bond A 0,2 0,1 1,1 1,2
place A companion.ash 0,1
place A creature.fire-warrior 1,1
place A item.flame-blade 1,1
place A item.spark-amulet 1,1
place A structure.barrack 1,2
place B creature.stone-brute 1,0
place B companion.moss 0,-2
handcard A spell.blink spell.recall spell.raise creature.herald creature.cinder-spirit
handcard B spell.recall spell.smite
mana A Fire 5
mana A Light 2
mana A Water 2
mana A Darkness 3
